+   entry .f32   `F32` corresponde a `f32`, o `float` do WebIDL
+   entry .f64   `F64` corresponde a `f64`, o `double` do WebIDL
+   entry .boolean   `Boolean` corresponde a `boolean`
+   entry .string   `Text` corresponde a `string`: `DOMString`, `USVString`, `ByteString` e `CSSOMString`
+   entry .sequence   um `List[T]` corresponde a `sequence<T>`
